{"branch":"별내점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">별내점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-fb056946f0b1349f.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"별내점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-fb056946f0b1349f.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 남양주시 순화궁로 349 삼광프라자 501호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>화성프라자.카페거리</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>화성프라자.카페거리</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>별사랑마을2-2단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>주을곡.남재공원</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>주을곡.남재공원</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>별사랑마을2-2단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>별내커뮤니티센터</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>용암천6교.카페거리북단</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>별내커뮤니티센터</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">10</span><span>효성해링턴코트.별내커뮤니티센터</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>81</span><span>땡큐30</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>48</span><span>48-1</span><span>82A</span><span>땡큐85</span><span>85-1</span><span>땡큐20</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">간선</span></dt><dd><span>202</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">직행</span></dt><dd><span>1001</span></dd></div></dl></d